{"title":"Yarn Swap","startsAt":"2026-11-02T16:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-02T18:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"This meet up is a special one! Use this as an opportunity to clean out your stash. Bring any unwanted yarn, books/patterns, hooks/needles... Even if you don't bring anything you are still welcome to pick up some crafting supplies.\n\n[Follow us on Instagram ](https://www.instagram.com/midtown_makers?stkn=Nno2Nml5a2YzYWZ4&utm_source=qr)","venue":{"name":"927 Mount Pleasant Road","address":"927 Mt Pleasant Rd, Toronto, ON M4P 2L7, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.711918,"lng":-79.391235,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Midtown Makers","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/5/2/9/highres_536398665.jpeg"}